    description: "WHAT. Campaign 3 (WI-gojov) was not clean: 12 failed tests outside the selection, all from one shape (a module fixture's closure keeping its own cache), fixed by INV-kazud (PR #2255). Run the weighted planted-fault campaign again on a dev that has the fix, with a FRESH seed (not 20261118) so it plants other faults, and after a full run has folded the index (so every test's rows reflect the marks).\n\nHOW. ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/bar/campaign3.py --out bar/campaign4 --per-shape 8 --seed <new>. Before it: smart-test --full on dev (folds the index), stored graph rebuilt for HEAD. Replay every miss alone (-n 0) with and without the fault (bar/replay_misses.py) before calling it real; a miss that fails alone is real, one that does not reproduce goes to WI-holuj.\n\nCLOSE CONDITION. Summary in the notebook: planted, type gate, ran, failed a test, failed tests, kept, named, outside, by shape. Zero real misses: WI-pugol may proceed (state with the count that this bounds the miss rate and does not prove it zero). One real miss: the selector stays off and the miss is filed."  # de9e
